{"type":"exercise","type_name":"Exercise","number":"","title":"A1","title_html":"A1","html":"<p>A model contains an indicator for one level of a categorical\ncovariate, and every observation at that level has <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"y_i=1\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>. Exhibit a separating direction,\nsay which of the three cases of <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"def-bin-separation\">@def-bin-separation</span> holds, and\ndescribe the fit.</p>","file":"ch35-binary-responses/03-separation.html"}